00:27:24.776 --> 00:27:28.113 line:0%
SO IT'S LIKE THIS REALLY
COMPLEX NOISE THAT MIMICS

00:27:28.113 --> 00:27:29.681 line:0%
A BABY'S CRY.

00:27:29.681 --> 00:27:31.716 line:0%
SO IT MAKES US FEEL LIKE,
