00:27:31.716 --> 00:27:34.019 line:0%
I NEED TO DO
SOMETHING ABOUT THAT."

00:27:39.024 --> 00:27:41.259 line:0%
<i>NARRATOR: BUT THAT'S ONLY
SCRATCHING THE SURFACE OF HOW</i>

00:27:41.259 --> 00:27:43.395 line:0%
<i>YOUR CAT MAY BE
CONTROLLING YOU.</i>

00:27:43.395 --> 00:27:47.198 line:0%
<i>GET READY FOR THE EIGHTH
