00:27:59.010 --> 00:28:02.013 line:0%
<i>SAY HELLO TO
TOXOPLASMA GONDII...</i>

00:28:03.281 --> 00:28:07.252 line:0%
<i>A MIND CONTROL PARASITE THAT
STARTS OUT IN SOME MICE.</i>

00:28:08.086 --> 00:28:11.723 line:0%
<i>NORMALLY, WHEN A MOUSE SMELLS
A CAT, IT RUNS THE OTHER WAY.</i>

00:28:12.791 --> 00:28:15.260 line:0%
<i>BUT MICE WITH THIS
PARASITE ARE ATTRACTED TO</i>

00:28:15.260 --> 00:28:17.829 line:0%
<i>THE SMELL OF CATS.</i>

00:28:17.829 --> 00:28:21.666 line:0%
<i>PROBLEM IS, WHEN CATS EAT THE
MICE, THEY GET THE BUG TOO...</i>

00:28:21.966 --> 00:28:26.371 line:0%
<i>THEN PASS IT ONTO US THROUGH
LITTER BOXES OR INFECTED SOIL.</i>

00:28:27.472 --> 00:28:30.608 line:0%
<i>SO WHAT DOES IT
DO TO INFECTED HUMANS?</i>

00:28:30.608 --> 00:28:32.343 line:0%
<i>DELAYED REACTION TIMES.</i>

00:28:32.343 --> 00:28:34.546 line:0%
<i>A TENDENCY TO GET
IN AUTO ACCIDENTS.</i>

00:28:34.546 --> 00:28:36.181 line:0%
<i>SLOPPINESS IN MEN...</i>

00:28:36.181 --> 00:28:37.649 line:0%
<i>NEATNESS IN WOMEN...</i>

00:28:37.649 --> 00:28:39.851 line:0%
MARTY: YOU KNOW, THERE ARE
SOME RESEARCH OUT TO SUGGEST

00:28:39.851 --> 00:28:42.020 line:0%
THAT SOME PEOPLE COULD
HAVE SCHIZOPHRENIA AND OTHER

00:28:42.020 --> 00:28:45.890 line:0%
CONDITIONS FROM BEING
EXPOSED TO TOXOPLASMOSIS.

00:28:48.727 --> 00:28:51.830 line:0%
<i>NARRATOR: IT SOUNDS LIKE IT
BELONGS IN A SCI-FI MOVIE...</i>

00:28:51.830 --> 00:28:54.799 line:0%
<i>UNTIL YOU HEAR THAT BETWEEN
30 AND 50% OF ALL</i>

00:28:54.799 --> 00:28:58.436 line:0%
<i>HUMANS ON EARTH CARRY
A TOXOPLASMA INFECTION.</i>

00:28:58.770 --> 00:29:00.972 line:0%
MIEHSHELLE: I'VE BEEN
TESTED FOR IT AND I'VE BEEN

00:29:00.972 --> 00:29:02.340 line:0%
