I DON'T KNOW HOW
MUCH THAT IS TRUE.

00:29:11.015 --> 00:29:13.017 line:0%
<i>NARRATOR: IT'S LIKE
A FELINE INVASION OF</i>

00:29:13.017 --> 00:29:14.519 line:0%
<i>THE BODY SNATCHERS!</i>

00:29:14.519 --> 00:29:16.621 line:0%
<i>SO MAYBE THAT'S
THE REAL REASON CATS ARE</i>

00:29:16.621 --> 00:29:18.189 line:0%
<i>THE MOST POPULAR PET.</i>

00:29:18.189 --> 00:29:20.592 line:0%
<i>THEY'RE CONTROLLING
OUR BRAINS.</i>

00:29:21.793 --> 00:29:23.695 line:0%
<i>THANKS A LOT, SHEEBA!</i>

00:29:29.267 --> 00:29:34.205 line:0%
<i>IT CREATES GHOSTS WITH ITS INK
AND CAN TASTE WITH ITS BODY.</i>

00:29:36.841 --> 00:29:41.179 line:0%
<i>SEVER ONE OF ITS LIMBS AND IT
