00:29:48.987 --> 00:29:51.122 line:0%
<i>AND SOME PEOPLE
EVEN BELIEVE...</i>

00:29:51.122 --> 00:29:54.659 line:0%
<i>IT CAN PREDICT THE FUTURE.</i>

00:29:54.659 --> 00:29:56.528 line:0%
<i>THE OCTOPUS...</i>

00:29:56.528 --> 00:29:58.329 line:0%
<i>IS NEXT.</i>

00:30:04.736 --> 00:30:08.673 line:0%
<i>NARRATOR: IT PUMPS
BLOOD USING THREE HEARTS,</i>

00:30:09.207 --> 00:30:13.011 line:0%
<i>IT CAN TASTE WITH THE
