00:30:14.078 --> 00:30:16.381 line:0%
<i>IF THEIR LIMBS
GET RIPPED OFF,</i>

00:30:16.381 --> 00:30:18.483 line:0%
<i>THEY CAN START TO
REGROW IN AS LITTLE</i>

00:30:18.483 --> 00:30:20.652 line:0%
<i>AS THREE DAYS...</i>

00:30:20.652 --> 00:30:24.322 line:0%
<i>SOME PEOPLE HAVE EVEN
