<i>YEAR OR TWO...</i>

00:30:30.562 --> 00:30:33.364 line:0%
<i>IT'S THE OCTOPUS...</i>

00:30:33.865 --> 00:30:38.236 line:0%
<i>ONE OF THE MOST
CUNNING SURVIVALISTS.</i>

00:30:45.443 --> 00:30:49.647 line:0%
<i>BENEATH THE OCEAN'S SURFACE,
THE OCTOPUS IS CONSTANTLY</i>

00:30:49.647 --> 00:30:52.317 line:0%
<i>ON THE RUN.</i>

00:30:53.518 --> 00:30:56.955 line:0%
ROGER HANLON: I CAN GLIBLY
DESCRIBE AN OCTOPUS AS A YUMMY

00:30:56.955 --> 00:30:59.290 line:0%
HUNK OF PROTEIN SWIMMING
