00:31:05.697 --> 00:31:08.600 line:0%
<i>NARRATOR: SO THE OCTOPUS
MUST EMPLOY SOME TRULY UNIQUE</i>

00:31:08.600 --> 00:31:11.269 line:0%
<i>SKILLS TO STAY ALIVE.</i>

00:31:12.737 --> 00:31:15.607 line:0%
<i>NOW, WE'RE BREAKING DOWN
