00:31:15.607 --> 00:31:18.376 line:0%
<i>AVOIDS BEING LUNCH.</i>

00:31:18.643 --> 00:31:21.646 line:0%
<i>THE FIRST AND ONE OF THE
MOST IMPORTANT OF ITS TOOLS</i>

00:31:21.646 --> 00:31:24.282 line:0%
<i>IS ITS AMAZING ABILITY...</i>

00:31:24.916 --> 00:31:27.218 line:0%
<i>TO CAMOUFLAGE.</i>

00:31:31.556 --> 00:31:34.492 line:0%
NATALIA: THESE OCTOPUSES,
THEY'RE JUST CONSTANTLY,

00:31:34.492 --> 00:31:38.396 line:0%
YOU KNOW, CHANGING,
ADAPTING TO BECOME A STEALTHY

00:31:38.396 --> 00:31:41.366 line:0%
NINJA OF THE SEA.

00:31:41.366 --> 00:31:43.668 line:0%
<i>NARRATOR: JUST
