00:31:47.906 --> 00:31:50.775 line:0%
<i>ITS COLOR AND PATTERN.</i>

00:31:51.009 --> 00:31:55.246 line:0%
ROGER: WE CALL THIS RAPID
ADAPTIVE COLORATION.

00:31:55.613 --> 00:31:58.583 line:0%
THE ICONIC ANIMAL THE GENERAL
PUBLIC THINKS ABOUT FOR

00:31:58.583 --> 00:32:01.586 line:0%
CHANGING COLOR AND
PATTERN IS THE CHAMELEON.

00:32:02.487 --> 00:32:06.724 line:0%
BUT THEY HAVE A SLOW CHANGE
