00:32:11.362 --> 00:32:13.998 line:0%
<i>NARRATOR: THE SECRET TO AN
OCTOPUS'S QUICK COLOR CHANGE</i>

00:32:13.998 --> 00:32:17.001 line:0%
<i>IS HIDDEN JUST UNDER
THE SURFACE OF THE SKIN.</i>

00:32:17.302 --> 00:32:19.938 line:0%
<i>HERE'S HOW IT WORKS.</i>

00:32:20.171 --> 00:32:22.874 line:0%
<i>AT REST, AN OCTOPUSES
